# armour-spells: from the menu, load the saved game setup/armour-spells writes (a new character,
# wearing no armour, with a scroll of Resist Blows in the pack's first slot and one of Iron Flesh
# in its second); use the first (the left button), which casts Resist Blows (armour level 2), and
# eleven seconds later the second, which casts Iron Flesh (level 5). With the fix the player's
# armour at every hit location is 2 after the first and 5 after the second (the best level, not
# the sum); without it (the original: the same recording with its enhancements chunk naming
# skip-intro alone) it stays 0. tools/armourcheck.py reads the values from the armour probe
3000 key enter         # Journey Onward
4500 key enter         # the first saved game
9000 move 250 92       # the scroll of Resist Blows, used
9300 mdown 250 92 left
9500 mup 250 92 left
20000 move 268 92      # the scroll of Iron Flesh, used
20100 mdown 268 92 left
20300 mup 268 92 left
24000 move 160 100
